aline is mainly produced by the inner layer of the adrenal cortex, called the medulla.\n- Other types of cancer, such as lung cancer, breast cancer, or lymphoma, can indirectly affect the adrenal glands by producing substances that stimulate the adrenal cortex to produce more cortisol", "new_cot_probs": [6.330121686914936e-05, 0.0006805522134527564], "cot_prob": [-69.0], "cot_step_prob": [-73.0]}}}
